OL,5,G1830 Monitoring the Welsh Coast
OL,6,     FAli Kedge finds out how this small
OL,7,     Fresearch centre is gathering and
OL,8,     Fdelivering crucial coastal
OL,9,     Finformation in a variety of ways
OL,10,     Fand takes a different look at the
OL,11,     FWelsh coastline.
OL,12,G1900 Huw Stephens
OL,13,     FHuw Stephens has a rule of three
OL,14,     Faround dogs, his album club and
OL,15,     Fnew Welsh music.
OL,16,G2100 James Dean Bradfield
OL,17,     FJames Dean Bradfield opens his
OL,18,     Frecord collection to share tracks
OL,19,     Ffrom his life, from tour bus
OL,20,     Fanthems and rock star memories to
OL,21,     Fthe tracks that continue to
OL,22,     Finspire him.
